  "content": "<article class=\"gl-experience\">\n<section class=\"gl-exp-hero gl-exp-wrap\">\n<div class=\"gl-exp-intro\"><p class=\"gl-exp-kicker\">THE GIOLINA EXPERIENCE</p><h1>A thoughtful approach.<br><span>From the start.</span></h1><p class=\"gl-exp-lead\">Personal attention.<br>Careful preparation.</p><p>We get to know you before the wedding, talk through your plans, and arrive ready to capture the day as it unfolds.</p><a class=\"gl-exp-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Let’s talk about your day <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div>\n<figure class=\"gl-exp-hero-photo\"><div class=\"gl-image-rotation\" data-rotate-images data-selected-portfolio-images style=\"--image-ratio:935/785\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><!-- Selected existing portfolio images; swap individually after archive selection. First frame remains the permanent fallback layer. --><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 35%\" src=\"/assets/e4af9615d9109ffc.jpg\" class=\"is-current is-fallback\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"GioLina wedding photography\"><img style=\"--image-focal:50% 28%\" data-src=\"/assets/299da5e07f2f4921.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:48% 35%\" data-src=\"/assets/cefe0daaa70fe868.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img style=\"--image-focal:26% 40%\" data-src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><figcaption>Prepared, so you can relax.</figcaption></figure>\n</section>\n<section class=\"gl-exp-statement\" id=\"our-approach\"><div class=\"gl-exp-wrap\"><p class=\"gl-exp-kicker\">CARE BEHIND THE CAMERA</p><h2>Room to enjoy being <em>together.</em></h2><p>Good preparation lets us stay attentive without taking over. We anticipate what matters, work calmly around you, and leave space for you to enjoy the people you love.</p></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-exp-process gl-exp-wrap\"><div class=\"gl-exp-section-title\"><p class=\"gl-exp-kicker\">BEFORE, DURING &amp; AFTER</p><h2>A personal process.</h2></div><div class=\"gl-exp-steps\">\n<div><span class=\"gl-exp-number\">01</span><h3>Get to know each other.</h3><p>Tell us about your plans and the people who matter to you. Together, we’ll talk through the day, your priorities, and what you’d like us to capture.</p></div>\n<div><span class=\"gl-exp-number\">02</span><h3>Be yourselves.</h3><p>With that preparation in place, we can anticipate the important parts of your day and remain unobtrusive. You can relax and be yourselves.</p></div>\n<div><span class=\"gl-exp-number\">03</span><h3>Make it personal.</h3><p>Afterward, we carefully shape your photographs and films with the same attention to the people, emotion, and moments that made the day yours.</p></div>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-exp-review gl-exp-wrap\"><figure><img src=\"/assets/julia-mina.png\" width=\"446\" height=\"183\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Julia &amp; Mina\"></figure><div><p class=\"gl-exp-kicker\">IN OUR COUPLES’ WORDS</p><h2>At ease, from<br>start to finish.</h2><blockquote>We highly recommend GioLina Films and Frank for your wedding! Frank put us at ease from start to finish. From the moment of our consultation to the end product, he was great to work with. It was nice to have one less thing to worry about when it came to wedding vendors. He took our ideas and suggestions and made sure to capture our day in the way we could’ve only dreamed. Plus his prices are very competitive! We will definitely be recommending GioLina to all our friends.</blockquote><p class=\"gl-exp-credit\">— <span class=\"gl-exp-mina\">Julia &amp; Mina</span></p><a class=\"gl-exp-text-link\" href=\"/client-reviews/\">More reviews from our couples ↗</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-exp-film gl-exp-special\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-exp-special-title\"><div class=\"gl-exp-wrap\"><div class=\"gl-exp-special-heading\"><p class=\"gl-exp-kicker\">BEYOND THE WEDDING FILM</p><h2 id=\"gl-exp-special-title\">More to celebrate.</h2></div><div class=\"gl-same-day-intro\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Same Day Edits</p><h2>Your wedding day. On screen that same night.</h2><p>A Same Day Edit brings footage captured earlier in the day into a finished film to share with you and your guests during the celebration.</p></div><div class=\"gl-exp-celebrate-grid\"><article class=\"gl-film-card \"><div class=\"gl-film-preview\"><img src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/773475915-113c9c0724a0e350a867f79cb06f556f4f01a824d91d45d4d1100063bc76c7e2-d_640?region=us\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"328842441\" data-film-title=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby\" aria-label=\"Play film — Bianca &amp; Bobby\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Bianca &amp; Bobby</h3><p>Same Day Edit</p></article><article class=\"gl-film-card \"><div class=\"gl-film-preview\"><img src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/1528773968-7d1ebf4641dde66b29aeb0054eacaa92942abc62f723752c8aec519d740a6aaa-d_640?region=us\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Francesca &amp; Chris\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"761102048\" data-film-title=\"Francesca &amp; Chris\" aria-label=\"Play film — Francesca &amp; Chris\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Francesca &amp; Chris</h3><p>Same Day Edit</p></article><article class=\"gl-film-card \"><div class=\"gl-film-preview\"><img src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/658866095-d625674d051ca65833f878752253de52c76b2b360b18a2bbea7b73f827f10d1a-d_640?region=us\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Beginning of Something\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"236688446\" data-film-title=\"The Beginning of Something\" aria-label=\"Play film — The Beginning of Something\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>The Beginning of Something</h3><p>A surprise engagement</p></article></div><a class=\"gl-exp-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Explore our wedding films ↗</a></div></section>\n<aside class=\"gl-rtg-connection gl-exp-wrap\"><p>Beyond weddings, Frank’s production work continues through Ready To Go Productions.</p><a href=\"/ready-to-go-productions/\">Discover Ready To Go Productions →</a></aside><section class=\"gl-exp-faq gl-exp-wrap\"><div><p class=\"gl-exp-kicker\">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><h2>Before we<br>say hello.</h2></div><div class=\"gl-exp-questions\">\n<details><summary>What does a wedding cost?</summary><div class=\"gl-exp-starting-prices\" data-pending-content=\"starting-prices\"><!-- Exact starting prices await client decision. --><p>Photography starting at $____</p><p>Cinematography starting at $____</p></div><p>Coverage can be customized around your wedding, priorities and the coverage you would like.</p></details>\n<details><summary>Are there any surprise fees?</summary><p>No. Your proposal clearly outlines what's included before you book. Most collections include up to eight hours of coverage. Additional coverage, travel outside our standard service area, or services added later may involve an additional cost—and we'll always discuss that with you first.</p></details>\n<details><summary>How do we schedule a consultation?</summary><p>We’d love to talk through your plans. <a href=\"https://clients.giolina.co/schedule/61f5ca5de95956002dd1c3d7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Schedule a conversation</a> or <a href=\"/contact-us-2/\">send us an inquiry</a>.</p></details>\n</div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-exp-cta\"><div class=\"gl-exp-wrap\"><p class=\"gl-exp-kicker\">LET’S GET ACQUAINTED</p><h2>Something beautiful<br>begins with <span>hello.</span></h2><a class=\"gl-exp-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire about your wedding <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section>\n</article>\n<script src=\"/image-rotation.js\" defer></script>",
